#ASSERT `s 117.07 the person is exempt from the prohibition (a public officer, and the other persons s 117.07 names)` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: the person exports or imports a firearm, a prohibited weapon, a restricted weapon, a prohibited device, a firearm part or any prohibited ammunition
