#ASSERT `s 117.07 the person is exempt from the prohibition (a public officer, and the other persons s 117.07 names)` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: the person alters a firearm so that it is capable of, or manufactures or assembles any firearm with intent to produce a firearm that is capable of, discharging projectiles in rapid succession during one pressure of the trigger
#ASSERT `s 117.07 the person is exempt from the prohibition (a public officer, and the other persons s 117.07 names)` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: the person fails to report the loss, theft or finding of any firearm, prohibited weapon, restricted weapon, prohibited device, ammunition, prohibited ammunition or explosive substance, or the destruction of any such thing
#ASSERT `s 117.07 the person is exempt from the prohibition (a public officer, and the other persons s 117.07 names)` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: the person alters a serial number on a firearm
#ASSERT `s 117.07 the person is exempt from the prohibition (a public officer, and the other persons s 117.07 names)` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the act is the only reason the person would be guilty of an offence under this Act or the Firearms Act
#ASSERT `s 117.07 the person is exempt from the prohibition (a public officer, and the other persons s 117.07 names)` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING   -- s 117.07(2) public officer: the person is one: the other way it can fail ((JUST FALSE))
