-- s 117.12(1) a document purporting to be an authorization, a licence or a registration certificate is evidence of the statements contained in it: expected values follow the text (s 117.12(1))
#ASSERT `s 117.12(1) a document purporting to be an authorization, a licence or a registration certificate is evidence of the statements contained in it` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 117.12(1) a document purporting to be an authorization, a licence or a registration certificate is evidence of the statements contained in it` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the proceedings are proceedings under this Act or any other Act of Parliament
#ASSERT `s 117.12(1) a document purporting to be an authorization, a licence or a registration certificate is evidence of the statements contained in it` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the document purports to be an authorization, a licence or a registration certificate

-- s 117.12(2) a certified copy is admissible in evidence: expected values follow the text (s 117.12(2))
#ASSERT `s 117.12(2) a certified copy is admissible in evidence` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 117.12(2) a certified copy is admissible in evidence` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the proceedings are proceedings under this Act or any other Act of Parliament
#ASSERT `s 117.12(2) a certified copy is admissible in evidence` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the copy is of an authorization, a licence or a registration certificate
#ASSERT `s 117.12(2) a certified copy is admissible in evidence` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: it is certified as a true copy by the Registrar or a chief firearms officer

-- s 117.12(2) the certified copy has the same probative force as the original would have had: expected values follow the text (s 117.12(2))
#ASSERT `s 117.12(2) the certified copy has the same probative force as the original would have had` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 117.12(2) the certified copy has the same probative force as the original would have had` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the proceedings are proceedings under this Act or any other Act of Parliament
#ASSERT `s 117.12(2) the certified copy has the same probative force as the original would have had` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the copy is certified as a true copy by the Registrar or a chief firearms officer
#ASSERT `s 117.12(2) the certified copy has the same probative force as the original would have had` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- exception: there is evidence to the contrary

-- s 117.13(1) a certificate of an analyst is evidence without proof of the signature or official character: expected values follow the text (s 117.13(1))
#ASSERT `s 117.13(1) a certificate of an analyst is evidence without proof of the signature or official character` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 117.13(1) a certificate of an analyst is evidence without proof of the signature or official character` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the proceedings are in relation to a weapon, prohibited device, ammunition, prohibited ammunition or explosive substance, or a part or component of such a thing, under this Act or under section 19 of the Export and Import Permits Act in relation to subsection 15(2) of that Act
#ASSERT `s 117.13(1) a certificate of an analyst is evidence without proof of the signature or official character` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the certificate purports to be signed by an analyst
#ASSERT `s 117.13(1) a certificate of an analyst is evidence without proof of the signature or official character` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the certificate states that the analyst has analyzed the thing and states the results of the analysis

-- s 117.13(2) the party against whom a certificate of an analyst is produced may, with leave of the court, require the attendance of the analyst: expected values follow the text (s 117.13(2))
#ASSERT `s 117.13(2) the party against whom a certificate of an analyst is produced may, with leave of the court, require the attendance of the analyst` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 117.13(2) the party against whom a certificate of an analyst is produced may, with leave of the court, require the attendance of the analyst` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the party is the party against whom a certificate of an analyst is produced
#ASSERT `s 117.13(2) the party against whom a certificate of an analyst is produced may, with leave of the court, require the attendance of the analyst` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the court gives leave

-- s 117.13(3) the certificate of an analyst is barred from admission for want of reasonable notice before the trial: expected values follow the text (s 117.13(3))
#ASSERT `s 117.13(3) the certificate of an analyst is barred from admission for want of reasonable notice before the trial` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 117.13(3) the certificate of an analyst is barred from admission for want of reasonable notice before the trial` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the party intends to produce a certificate of an analyst
#ASSERT `s 117.13(3) the certificate of an analyst is barred from admission for want of reasonable notice before the trial` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- exception: the party has, before the trial, given the party against whom it is intended to be produced reasonable notice of that intention together with a copy of the certificate

-- s 117.14(1) the Governor in Council may declare an amnesty period: expected values follow the text (s 117.14(1))
#ASSERT `s 117.14(1) the Governor in Council may declare an amnesty period` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 117.14(1) the Governor in Council may declare an amnesty period` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the Governor in Council declares by order a period as an amnesty period for a purpose referred to in subsection (2)
#ASSERT `s 117.14(1) the Governor in Council may declare an amnesty period` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the order is with respect to a weapon, prohibited device, prohibited ammunition, explosive substance or component or part designed exclusively for use in the manufacture of or assembly into an automatic firearm

-- s 117.14(2) the order declares the amnesty period for a purpose subsection (2) names: expected values follow the text (s 117.14(2))
#ASSERT `s 117.14(2) the order declares the amnesty period for a purpose subsection (2) names` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 117.14(2) the order declares the amnesty period for a purpose subsection (2) names` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the purpose is permitting any person in possession of any thing to which the order relates to do anything provided in the order, including delivering the thing to a peace officer, a firearms officer or a chief firearms officer, registering it, destroying it or otherwise disposing of it / the purpose is permitting alterations to be made to any prohibited firearm, prohibited weapon, prohibited device or prohibited ammunition to which the order relates so that it no longer qualifies as such
#ASSERT `s 117.14(2) the order declares the amnesty period for a purpose subsection (2) names` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: the purpose is permitting any person in possession of any thing to which the order relates to do anything provided in the order, including delivering the thing to a peace officer, a firearms officer or a chief firearms officer, registering it, destroying it or otherwise disposing of it
#ASSERT `s 117.14(2) the order declares the amnesty period for a purpose subsection (2) names` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- alternative present: the purpose is permitting alterations to be made to any prohibited firearm, prohibited weapon, prohibited device or prohibited ammunition to which the order relates so that it no longer qualifies as such

-- s 117.14(3) the person is not guilty of an offence under this Part by reason only of doing a thing provided for in an amnesty order: expected values follow the text (s 117.14(3))
#ASSERT `s 117.14(3) the person is not guilty of an offence under this Part by reason only of doing a thing provided for in an amnesty order` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 117.14(3) the person is not guilty of an offence under this Part by reason only of doing a thing provided for in an amnesty order` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the person does anything provided for in the order
#ASSERT `s 117.14(3) the person is not guilty of an offence under this Part by reason only of doing a thing provided for in an amnesty order` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: it is done during an amnesty period declared by an order made under subsection (1)
#ASSERT `s 117.14(3) the person is not guilty of an offence under this Part by reason only of doing a thing provided for in an amnesty order` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: it is done for a purpose described in the order

-- s 117.14(4) the proceedings are a nullity: expected values follow the text (s 117.14(4))
#ASSERT `s 117.14(4) the proceedings are a nullity` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- every element of the provision present
#ASSERT `s 117.14(4) the proceedings are a nullity` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- element missing: the proceedings are taken under this Part against a person for anything done by the person in reliance of this section
